2.b.) Perform test of the system functionality (&lt;customer specific&gt;)
2.c.) read again error memory entry (&lt;customer specific&gt;), if error memory entry is still present - replace the ECU

special measure: SW update (potential errata) in case of SW dependant known issues</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_474518921">EDM_SYSTEMCOND_ALWAYS_ON</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_713037638">Startup/Initialization</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1528861213">The failure event "EVENT_L3_MU_SW_CONFIG" is set:
1a.) if the SBC is still in its INIT mode
      (MODE.INIT == 1) || (WD_WINDOW.WD_WINDOW == 3) 
2a.) and the Fault Error Counter is higher than the default value (1)
&amp;&amp; (DIAG_SF_ERR.FLT_ERR_2:0 &gt;= 2)
3a.) and the marker in the reset proof RAM indicates a unsuccessful configuration of the INIT registers of the Monitoring Unit
&amp;&amp; (RPRAM_SBC_InitTimeout == 1) 

or 

1b.) if the SBC is not longer in its INIT mode 
	(MODE.INIT !=1)
2b.) and the INIT registers of the Main Logic are already configure but not as intended
	(INIT_VREG != INIT_VREG_I) || (INIT_WU1 != INIT_WU1_I) || ( INIT_WU2 != INIT_WU2_I) || (INIT_INH_INT != INIT_INH_INT_I) || (INIT_INT != INIT_INT_I)</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
                                <DTC ID="DLC.DLC_MCU_F.BV.BV_MCU_F.DOP.DD_DTCList.DTC.DTCP1199F2">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCP1199F2</SHORT-NAME>
