                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1989785690">The failure event "EVENT_L3_MU_RSTb_CHECK" is set:
1a.) if the RSTB_DIAG bit of the DIAG_SF_IOs register reports a "RSTB short - circuit to high failure - detected by the ABIST1"
(DIAG_SF_IOs.RSTB_DIAG == 1)
1b.) or if the RSTB_SNS bit of the RELEASE_FSxB registers reports a "RSTB pad sense low although a high is expected"
||   (RELEASE_FSxB.RSTB_SNS == 0) </SD>
