&amp;&amp; (DIAG_VCORE: VCORE_FB_OV == 1)

#### PATH 2 - FCRBM_OV ####
3b.) or the FCRBM_OV bit of the DIAG_SF_ERR register reports an "Over voltage detection (FB_Core - FCRBM &lt; 150mV)"
|| (DIAG_SF_ERR: FCRBM_OV == 1)</SD>
