1.) if the RSTB_EXT bit of the DIAG_SF_IOs register reports a "external Reset"
&amp;&amp; (DIAG_SF_IOs: RSTB_EXT == 1)</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
