                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1996081447">The failure event "EVENT_L3_MCU_HW_CONFIG" is set if:
1a.) "tristate activation"is not lateched  in the "Hardware Configuration Setting of the Start-up Status Register
	(STSTAT.HWCFG[6] != 0b)
1b.) the EVR33 LDO regulator is not OFF as expected (in the selected 3V3 single source supply mode)
||	(STSTAT.HWCFG[1] != 0b)
1c.) the EVRC SMPS cor eregulator is not ON as expected (in the selected 3V3 single source supply mode)
||	(STSTAT.HWCFG[2] != 1b)    </SD>
