special measure: SW update (potential errata) in case of SW dependant known issues</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_474518921">EDM_SYSTEMCOND_ALWAYS_ON</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1783258699">Cyclic 10ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_2074265069">The failure event "EVENT_L3_MCU_DTS_TEMP_CROSS" is set:
1.) if the difference between the "Core Tempetrature" and the "PMS Temperature" is higher than a threshold
ABS (MCU_PMS_Temperature - MCU_CORE_Temperature)  &gt; P_MCU_DTSCrossCheckLim
2.) and the difference is present for a timespan longer than a filtertime **
&amp;&amp;   (t_DTSDebounceCrossCheck &gt;= P_MCU_DTSDebounceCrossCheck) </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
                                <DTC ID="DLC.DLC_MCU_F.BV.BV_MCU_F.DOP.DD_DTCList.DTC.DTCP119A49">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCP119A49</SHORT-NAME>
