                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1014095129"><![CDATA[The failure event "EVENT_L3_MCU_SMU_SRAM" is set:
1.) if the RSTb bit of the WD ANSWER register reports a "Reset"
(WD_ANSWER: RSTB == 1)    
2.) and the FSxB bit of the WD ANSWER register reports a "Fail-safe event"
&& (WD_ANSWER: FSxB == 1) 

3a.) and either the IO23_FAIL bit of the DIAG_FS_IOs register reports an "IO23 monitoring error"
&& ((DIAG_SF_IOs: IO_23_FAIL == 1) 
3b.) or the reset proof RAM marker indicates that the wrong WD data refresh was provoked due to a not executed SMU reaction (e.g. SMU_FSP stuck at high)
|| (RPRAM_IntendedWD_Error))


#### Path 1 - SRAM Monitor CPU0 / 1 ####
4a.) and a "CPU0/1 PCACHE TAG Uncorrectable critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
&& [(SMU_AG0.SF4) || (SMU_AG1.SF4) 
4b.) or a "CPU0/1 PCACHE TAG Miscellaneous error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG0.SF5) || (SMU_AG1.SF5) 
4c.) or a "CPU0/1 PSPR/PCACHE Uncorrectable critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG0.SF7) || (SMU_AG1.SF7) 
4d.) or a "CPU0/1 PSPR/PCACHE Miscellaneous critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG0.SF8) || (SMU_AG1.SF8) 
4e.) or a "CPU0/1 DSPR/DCACHE/DLMU Uncorrectable critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG0.SF10) || (SMU_AG1.SF10) 
4f.) or a "CPU0/1 DSPR/DCACHE/DLMU Miscellaneous error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG0.SF11) || (SMU_AG1.SF11) 
4g.) or a "CPU0/1 DCACHE TAG Uncorrectable critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG0.SF13) || (SMU_AG1.SF13) 
4h.) or a "CPU0/1 DCACHE TAG Miscellaneous error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG0.SF14) || (SMU_AG1.SF14) 

#### Path 2 - SRAM Monitor Peripherals ####
4i.) or a "GTM Uncorrectable critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG6.SF11)
4j.) or a "GTM Miscellaneous error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG6.SF12)

4k.) or a "ERAY Uncorrectable critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG6.SF14)
4l.) or a "ERAY Miscellaneous error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG6.SF15)

4m.) or a "CAN Uncorrectable critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG6.SF17)
4n.) or a "CAN Miscellaneous error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG6.SF18)
4o.) or a "MISC Uncorrectable critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG6.SF20)
4p.) or a "MISC Miscellaneous error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG6.SF21)
4q.) or a "NVM FSI_RAM Uncorrectable critical error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG7.SF1)
4r.) or a "NVM FSI_RAM Miscellaneous error detection" is reported in the SMU Alarm Status Register
|| (SMU_AG7.SF2)

]]></SD>
