                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1895374191">The failure event "EVENT_L3_PROGRAM_FLOW_MONITORING_L2." is set:
a.) if the CAP_SW_L2 software is not called in correct order
b.) if the CAP_SW_L2 software is not called in correct period or frequency</SD>
