                                <DTC ID="DLC.DLC_MCU_F.BV.BV_MCU_F.DOP.DD_DTCList.DTC.DTCP08EA94">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCP08EA94</SHORT-NAME>
                                    <TROUBLE-CODE>584340</TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>P08EA94</DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <TEXT TI="TI_947726151">DTC_PS_UNINTENDED_SLEEVE_POSITION_MOVEMENT</TEXT>
                                    <LEVEL>0</LEVEL>
                                    <SDGS>
                                        <SDG SI="EXTRAINFO">
                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1290368525">EDM_SYSTEMCOND_SFTY_TB_LV_PT_PET_ON_TR_P1_P2_FR_FT_FP_FltIrrv</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_324079000">Cyclic 2ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1020118571">Following condition have to be met when one of the gears or neutral is verified and no gear shift is initiated


IF gear D1 is engaged (V_curState == D1)

V_PosCorrS02_xSleeveD1GearThreshLo &lt; V_xSleeve &lt; xSleeveD1GearThreshUnintendedMvmtHi

ELSE IF gear N is engaged (V_curState == N)

V_xSleeveNGearThreshLo &lt; V_xSleeve &lt; V_xSleeveNGearThreshHi

END



If the condition is not fulfilled the error shall be set. </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_1999390981">0</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
                                <DTC ID="DLC.DLC_MCU_F.BV.BV_MCU_F.DOP.DD_DTCList.DTC.DTCP28C994">
